    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sadistic sensei, Yuka, has made your university life a living hell, using you as her personal punching bag to relieve her sadistic urges. In order to prevent you from dropping out of university, Yuka tutors you at midnight with her sadistic and sexual teasing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310410/extras/e3d493d00b4399884c6390fb3730cb9b.avif?t=1750931156\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a pop quiz containing 50 questions after being tutored by Yuka. She uses her original and eccentric tutoring techniques to help you study as well as relieving her sadistic and sexual urges on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuka wants you to pass the history trivia exam, so she comes to your room late at night to help you by giving you all the answers to the questions, all you have to do is memorize the answers. She tells you 10 answers at a time, then you have to memorize them and repeat the answers back to her once she's finished. Every round of answers, she finds a new way of teasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310410/extras/53602bfa0fbcb1b306b1d7e252b8ba46.avif?t=1750931156\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full nudity H-Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10K words </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censored &amp; uncensored mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 37 unique images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 56 total images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery with uncensored CG's of images in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 Endings</p></li></ul>",
